{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の京都全国握手会！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんとペアでした(^_-)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/21/4998584/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意味不なポーズ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型がそっくりすぎして自分達でもおかしくて笑っちゃった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"分け目、色、長さ、いっしょーーーー！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえーーいななみん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/21/4998584/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/21/4998584/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろ姿。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/21/4998584/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわっ！瓜二つ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみん押しの方達優しくて面白い方ばっかりでめっちゃ楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/21/4998584/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ族は相変わらず愛おしいです。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、6thの選抜発表があったね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條、選抜ならず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみは変わらずこれからも進んでいくつもりです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱり、悔しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のままじゃまた選抜に戻れるほどのものが自分にはないし、見つかりません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただの変にキャラが濃い能條じゃ駄目なんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の自分になにもひとつも満足なんかしてません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、またあみが選抜に必要とされる存在になって\n「よし、今の能條なら」って思ってもらえるように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"必ず、また選抜に戻ってみせます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、どうか待っていて下さい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もあみあみ族のみんなを信じるから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも、私のことを信じて下さい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうか、よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！今日は京都個別握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれたみんなありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/21/4998584/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながら本日は全身のやつがなくてアップなのしかない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/21/4998584/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかるかなー？今日は髪の毛外はねにさせたんだよ(＾ｰ^)ノういうい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服も上はオレンジなノースリーブ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏すぎた。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいんだよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おれの気分はいつでも夏のように燃えてんのさ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ういうい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んでね、あのね聞いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日ね、楽しいことしたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/21/4998584/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとわかりにくいんだけどね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣きボクロをライブ前に書いたんだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーさんとまあやとちーちゃんとあみで！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでおそろっち泣きボクロ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょうもないけど楽しい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私たちはまだまだ若い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/21/4998584/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都のホテルにて。\nな、なんかちょっと色っぽい？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆能條愛未のみにばなし☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近帽子を集めるのにハマってます。\nニット帽、キャップ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"集めてる。"}],"source":"archive"}